# Cardflow Project Guidelines

You are working in the root `cardflow` repository containing:
1. `cardflow-app/`: Next.js 16 Web & Expo Mobile (`fe-kit`).
2. `cardflow-backend/`: Go microservice (`go-kit`, Clean Architecture, Echo, fx).
3. `cardflow-docs/`: System documentation and API contracts.

## Rules:
- Shared memory is accessible via `tencent-memory` MCP configured in `.mcp.json`.
- Backend endpoints follow `/cardflow-backend/v1/<feature>/actions/<action>`.
- Frontend communicates with backend via `shared/src/api.ts` using port 8080.
- All code must pass `pnpm type-check` (in cardflow-app) and `go build ./...` (in cardflow-backend).
